          "prompt": "App API alias: ${{gate-map-app-demo-metadata-1.app_api_alias}}\nApp UI alias: ${{gate-map-app-demo-metadata-1.app_ui_alias}}\nApp API base URL: ${{gate-map-app-demo-metadata-1.app_base_url}}\nPublic UI URL: ${{gate-map-app-demo-metadata-1.app_public_url}}\nBrowser UI URL: ${{gate-map-app-demo-metadata-1.app_public_url}} (launch Chromium with EVANDER_PLAYWRIGHT_LAUNCH_HELPER)\nAPI relay URL: $HTTP_TARGET_RELAY_BASE_URL/session/${{gate-filter-5.session_id}}/target/${{gate-map-app-demo-metadata-1.app_api_alias}}/\nWhen generated images are needed for the requested demo, the user explicitly authorizes the imagegen skill's API/CLI fallback through the host OpenAI relay. Do not ask for separate confirmation. Use it only for assets for this named demo environment.",
